        id: "c4-5",
        speaker: "tom",
        says: "Never mind!",
        clues: [
          "You are looking through a box of lost things: gloves, scarves, an umbrella.",
          "Tom is holding up his keys and smiling.",
          "His bag is open on the table, with everything spread out.",
